#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Radar and traps 2"
msgstr "Radar e trappole 2"

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Try to figure out how to survive in a hostile environment."
msgstr "Trova il modo di sopravvivere in un ambiente ostile."

#. type: ScriptName-text
#: ../scene.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Traps"
msgstr "Traps"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exercise"
msgstr "Esercizio"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Instruct your <a object|bottr>bot</a> to find all the <a "
"object|waypoint>blue crosses</a> on the ground, but do not get too close to "
"the <a object|mine>mines</a>."
msgstr ""
"Programma il <a object|bottr>robot</a> perché trovi tutte le <a "
"object|waypoint>croci blu</a> senza avvicinarsi troppo alle <a "
"object|mine>mine</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If a bot gets within less than 2m of the center of a mine (which is the "
"position returned by the radar instruction), il will blow up. However, you "
"must take into account the inertia of the bot. Probably a safety distance of"
" 3 to 3.5m would be more appropriate."
msgstr ""
"A meno di 2 m dal centro di una mina, cioè la posizione restituita dal "
"radar, il robot esplode. Tieni conto dell’inerzia: conviene mantenere una "
"distanza di sicurezza di 3-3,5 m."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "See also"
msgstr "Vedi anche"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a "
"cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr ""
